1
00:00:00,571 --> 00:00:03,475
This is ACME Bank v2, a digital banking

2
00:00:03,495 --> 00:00:07,060
simulation built on Next.js and Supabase.

3
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:09,850
Let's walk through the app exactly as it runs today.

4
00:00:10,647 --> 00:00:12,148
We start at sign-in.

5
00:00:12,168 --> 00:00:15,544
The theme isn't applied yet, so the fields have no borders.

6
00:00:15,564 --> 00:00:17,785
A wrong password gets a generic error

7
00:00:17,805 --> 00:00:20,210
that doesn't reveal which emails exist.

8
00:00:20,874 --> 00:00:24,037
Password recovery works the same way: one neutral

9
00:00:24,057 --> 00:00:27,111
message, whether or not the account exists.

10
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,680
New customers can open a simulated account.

11
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:34,596
The consent step is separate, and the optional choices start unchecked.

12
00:00:34,616 --> 00:00:37,103
Submitting gives a neutral confirmation.

13
00:00:38,044 --> 00:00:42,328
Now we sign in as Avery, one of six seeded demo customers.

14
00:00:42,348 --> 00:00:46,604
The menu matches the customer role, but the overview is still empty.

15
00:00:47,287 --> 00:00:50,297
Accounts, Transfers, Cards and Statements are

16
00:00:50,317 --> 00:00:54,279
the same: placeholders, so only the menu renders.

17
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:57,512
Settings is the customer screen that works.

18
00:00:57,532 --> 00:01:01,199
Optional consents can be given and withdrawn at any time.

19
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:05,357
Behind the scenes, the API is live: the accounts

20
00:01:05,377 --> 00:01:08,808
endpoint returns Avery's balance, stored in cents.

21
00:01:09,466 --> 00:01:11,602
Roles are enforced on the server.

22
00:01:11,622 --> 00:01:15,183
A customer who opens the staff panel just gets: Forbidden.

23
00:01:15,855 --> 00:01:17,780
Let's sign out, and sign back in with the

24
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:20,689
administrator account, using the same form.

25
00:01:21,253 --> 00:01:26,075
The menu changes to Support, Staff panel, Simulation and Settings.

26
00:01:26,744 --> 00:01:28,657
But Settings crashes for the admin,

27
00:01:28,677 --> 00:01:31,636
because that page only authorizes customers.

28
00:01:32,321 --> 00:01:35,638
The staff panel is blank, without even the menu.

29
00:01:35,658 --> 00:01:38,150
The simulation page lists four scenarios,

30
00:01:38,170 --> 00:01:41,588
with no controls yet and an empty event log.

31
00:01:42,275 --> 00:01:46,578
The staff lookup API does respond, with a minimal customer summary.

32
00:01:47,506 --> 00:01:52,168
In short: authentication, consent, role checks and the API layer

33
00:01:52,188 --> 00:01:56,055
are in place, while most screens and the theme are still to be built.
